# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# dist/ (Vite build output) is COMMITTED, not ignored: Go module archives
# contain only git-tracked files, so `go install` embeds the real web UI only
# if the bundles are in git (#376). CI verifies the committed dist matches a
# fresh build ("Web UI dist freshness"). After changing playground/src or the
# locked deps, run `mage webbuild` and commit the regenerated dist/.
dist-ssr
*.local

